    "headline_insight": {
      "as_of": "2026-06-26T04:30:46.892888+00:00",
      "insight": "Readers are not clicking post-quantum stories for abstract threat warnings — they click when a specific chain names a deadline, a real cost, or a concrete mechanism, revealing that urgency is only credible when it comes with a migration date or a line of code.",
